/**
@page api_markov Markov Chain Modules
@brief CTMC and DTMC analysis

These modules provide tools for analyzing Markov chains and related stochastic processes.

@section markov_mc Markov Chain Analysis

The mc module provides general tools for analyzing both continuous-time and discrete-time
Markov chains, including steady-state and transient analysis.

@subsection markov_ctmc_steady CTMC Steady-State Analysis

- @ref ctmc_solve.m "ctmc_solve" - Equilibrium distribution of the continuous-time Markov chain

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [p, Q, nConnComp, connComp] = ctmc_solve(Q, options)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>options</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>p</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>nConnComp</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>connComp</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Equilibrium distribution of the continuous-time Markov chain

- @ref ctmc_relsolve.m "ctmc_relsolve" - Computes the equilibrium distribution relative to a reference state

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [p, Q, nConnComp, connComp] = ctmc_relsolve(Q, refstate, options)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>refstate</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>options</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>p</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>nConnComp</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>connComp</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes the equilibrium distribution relative to a reference state

- @ref ctmc_timereverse.m "ctmc_timereverse" - Computes the time-reversed generator of a CTMC

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  ctmc_timereverse(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Computes the time-reversed generator of a CTMC

- @ref ctmc_solve_reducible.m "ctmc_solve_reducible" - 

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, pis, pi0, scc, isrec] = ctmc_solve_reducible(Q, pi0, options)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>options</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pis</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>scc</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>isrec</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>


- @ref ctmc_stochcomp.m "ctmc_stochcomp" - [S,Q11,Q12,Q21,Q22,T] = CTMC_STOCHCOMP(Q,I)

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [S, Q11, Q12, Q21, Q22, T] = ctmc_stochcomp(Q, I)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>I</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>S</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q11</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q12</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q21</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q22</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>T</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> [S,Q11,Q12,Q21,Q22,T] = CTMC_STOCHCOMP(Q,I)

- @ref ctmc_takahashi.m "ctmc_takahashi" - CTMC_TAKAHASHI - Takahashi's aggregation-disaggregation method

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [p, p_1, pcourt, Qperm] = ctmc_takahashi(Q, MS, numSteps)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MS</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>numSteps</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>p</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>p_1</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pcourt</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Qperm</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> CTMC_TAKAHASHI - Takahashi's aggregation-disaggregation method

- @ref ctmc_courtois.m "ctmc_courtois" - CTMC_COURTOIS - Courtois decomposition

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [p, Qperm, Qdec, eps, epsMAX, P, B, C, q] = ctmc_courtois(Q, MS, q)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MS</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>p</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Qperm</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Qdec</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>eps</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>epsMAX</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>B</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>C</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>q</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> CTMC_COURTOIS - Courtois decomposition

- @ref ctmc_kms.m "ctmc_kms" - CTMC_KMS - Koury-McAllister-Stewart aggregation-disaggregation method

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [p, p_1, Qperm, eps, pcourt] = ctmc_kms(Q, MS, numSteps)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MS</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>numSteps</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>p</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>p_1</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Qperm</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>eps</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pcourt</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> CTMC_KMS - Koury-McAllister-Stewart aggregation-disaggregation method


@subsection markov_ctmc_transient CTMC Transient Analysis

- @ref ctmc_transient.m "ctmc_transient" - [PI,T]=CTMC_TRANSIENT(Q,PI0,T0,T1)

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, t] = ctmc_transient(Q, pi0, t0, t1)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t1</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> [PI,T]=CTMC_TRANSIENT(Q,PI0,T0,T1)

- @ref ctmc_uniformization.m "ctmc_uniformization" - [PI,KMAX]=CTMC_UNIFORMIZATION(PI0,Q,T,TOL,MAXITER)

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, kmax] = ctmc_uniformization(pi0, Q, t, tol, maxiter)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tol</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>maxiter</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>kmax</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> [PI,KMAX]=CTMC_UNIFORMIZATION(PI0,Q,T,TOL,MAXITER)

- @ref ctmc_randomization.m "ctmc_randomization" - Uniformization (randomization) of a continuous-time Markov chain

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [P, q] = ctmc_randomization(Q, q)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>q</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>q</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Uniformization (randomization) of a continuous-time Markov chain

- @ref ctmc_simulate.m "ctmc_simulate" - 

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [soujt, sts] = ctmc_simulate(Q, pi0, n)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
