@subsection markov_dtmc Discrete-Time Markov Chain (DTMC) Functions

<b>Steady-State Analysis:</b>

- @ref dtmc_solve.m "dtmc_solve" - Equilibrium distribution of the discrete-time Markov chain

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  dtmc_solve(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Equilibrium distribution of the discrete-time Markov chain

- @ref dtmc_timereverse.m "dtmc_timereverse" - Computes the time-reversed transition matrix of a DTMC

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  dtmc_timereverse(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Computes the time-reversed transition matrix of a DTMC

- @ref dtmc_stochcomp.m "dtmc_stochcomp" - Computes the stochastic complement of a DTMC partition

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [S, P11, P12, P21, P22] = dtmc_stochcomp(P, I)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>I</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>S</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P11</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P12</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P21</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P22</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes the stochastic complement of a DTMC partition

- @ref dtmc_solve_reducible.m "dtmc_solve_reducible" - [PI,PIS,PI0,SCC,ISREC,PL,PIL] = DTMC_SOLVE_REDUCIBLE(P, PIN, OPTIONS)

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, pis, pi0, scc, isrec, Pl, pil] = dtmc_solve_reducible(P, pin, options)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pin</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>options</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pis</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>scc</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>isrec</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Pl</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pil</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> [PI,PIS,PI0,SCC,ISREC,PL,PIL] = DTMC_SOLVE_REDUCIBLE(P, PIN, OPTIONS)

- @ref dtmc_simulate.m "dtmc_simulate" - Simulates a trajectory of a discrete-time Markov chain

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  sts = dtmc_simulate(P, pi0, n)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>n</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>sts</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Simulates a trajectory of a discrete-time Markov chain

- @ref dtmc_rand.m "dtmc_rand" - Generates a random stochastic transition matrix

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  dtmc_rand(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Generates a random stochastic transition matrix

- @ref dtmc_makestochastic.m "dtmc_makestochastic" - Normalizes a matrix to be a valid stochastic matrix

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  dtmc_makestochastic(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Normalizes a matrix to be a valid stochastic matrix

- @ref dtmc_isfeasible.m "dtmc_isfeasible" - Checks feasibility of a stochastic matrix

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  dtmc_isfeasible(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Checks feasibility of a stochastic matrix

- @ref dtmc_uniformization.m "dtmc_uniformization" - Computes transient probabilities for a DTMC using uniformization

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, kmax] = dtmc_uniformization(pi0, P, t, tol, maxiter)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tol</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>maxiter</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>kmax</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes transient probabilities for a DTMC using uniformization


